  "scope_limits": [
    "The state child uses a temporary current-thread Tokio runtime that ends before drop(opening); these are runtime-shutdown plus cancellation controls, not an independent runtime-alive-cancellation qualification.",
    "The state parent line-reader forwards checkpoint lines to captured stderr and discards other child stdout; inherited child stderr remains visible. No claim of complete arbitrary child stdout retention.",
    "State physical lock contention is between actual parent and child; Memory uses a separately opened real File lock in the same process. Do not label the Memory case cross-process.",
